#section("general", title: "General Overview")[
  This Portfolio is designed to showcase the general, professional and technical aspects of my career, particularly as a student in Oceanic, Atmospheric and Climate Sciences, but also my personal interests. It aims to provide a comprehensive overview of my skills and experiences.

  #html.elem("h3")[My Story]
  After obtaining my high school diploma in science, I headed to the Applied Physics Bachelor's degree. I wanted to keep my future career wide open thanks to a multidisciplinary degree. I graduated with a *Materials and Physico-Chemical Controls specialization*.

  I am now pursuing a *master's degree in Ocean, Atmosphere and Climate Sciences*, at the University of Toulouse, France.

  #html.elem("h3")[My Hobbies]
  I have two main hobbies: *mountain biking* and *fishing*!

  I've been a mountain biker for the last decade and have consistently ridden my bike every weekend, going on epic rides throughout the south of France and even in America!

  As for fishing, I started during the pandemic in 2020, and now I go whenever I don’t get the chance to ride my bike. I usually fish for trout or pike.

